<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head.ejs') %>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav.ejs') %>
    <main class="about">
        <div>
            <h1>About This Site</h1>
            <p>This site gives an overview of five widely used programming languages:
               JavaScript, C, Python, Java and C++.</p>

            <h2>Data Sources</h2>
            <p><strong>Node package:</strong>
               <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/pldb">pldb</a>
               (Programming Language Database) provides each language's year, creator,
               country and latest version.</p>
            <p><strong>Web API:</strong> The
               <a href="https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Page_Content_Service">Wikipedia REST API</a>
               provides each language's summary and image.</p>

            <h2>Built With</h2>
            <p>Node.js, Express, EJS templates and partials, and an external CSS stylesheet.</p>
            <p>Hosted on Render</p>

        </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer.ejs') %>
</body>
</html>